### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234!",
  "userName": "test",
  "phoneNumber": "01012345678"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234!"
}